<title>UK: One Brent date kept, the other clocked - trade.</title>
<headline>One Brent date kept, the other clocked - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Of the two 3-5 January Brent cargoes to be nominated from the paper chain on Thursday, one was kept and the other clocked, traders said.</p>
<p>J Aron was clocked and Stasco kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, they added.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
